{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-41336d", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-043"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "note": "書簡を三人称の情景へ反転した変奏。同じ問いと素材を継ぎ、結びの留保を『雨が先に触れる』という言い切りへ置き換える。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-12d973", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-043"}, "note": "「届くかどうかを、確かめないまま」で止まった受領の留保へ、用を問う前に触れたことは終わらないという宣言で切り込む。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-a340d0", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "note": "雨が手紙に触れたという言い切りへ、奪うことと触れることの差と、開く指で切断を返す。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-6c05af", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "note": "触れるを受領から切り離す情景と、触れるを開くことに置く手紙を、同じ素材と問いの上で対置する。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-e092d1", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-096"}, "note": "触覚を皮膚と手に還元せず書くという問いに、雨で裏返った便箋の情景で応える。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-91a875", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-096"}, "note": "所有と保持に還元せず書くという問いに、指が引き受ける確かめと、読めない半分を抱えた束で応える。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-ca329e", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-082"}, "note": "同じ素材と問いを継いだ版の差を、結論だけが反転した二編の並置として示す。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-e08567", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-043"}, "note": "旧稿の結びの一節を本文の便りの結びに引き、確かめないと言った声の代わりに確かめる指を置く。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-a28461", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-411"}, "note": "古池に飛び込む蛙の跳ねと、岸へ届いて消える波紋を、堤の溝の情景へ移す。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-b6b4ca", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-412"}, "note": "雨に負けずに歩く動作を、庇を探さない朝の堤の歩き方へ移す。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-4888e8", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-410"}, "note": "満月の詠のすぐ裏にある欠落を、届いた束の読めない半分の構造へ移す。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-a0d349", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-f06948"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-414"}, "note": "届くことを保証しない呼びかけを、指が確かめを引き受ける手紙の前提に置く。"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261029-380ccd", "created_at": "2026-10-29", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-413"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261029-562eb3"}, "note": "『生きる、それだけで、誰かの役に立つ』の、数える前の順序を、役に立たなくなった便箋の情景が受け取る。"}
